    ["<Assistant_Title1>【心意派送中】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>城市漫游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>长椅旁，几位少男少女聚在一起低声交谈，目光不时飘向黑荆棘安保公司那扇紧闭的门。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(792,908)]|-20980;-9030;-1499;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Heartfelt Delivery】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Beside a bench, a few young boys and girls are gathered together, whispering to each other, their gazes drifting from time to time toward the closed door of the Blackthorn Security Company.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(792,908)]|-20980;-9030;-1499;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>攻击提高<Mark>275</>。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</> Attack increased by <Mark> 275 </>. \n Does not take effect when activating the set <Mark> Echo of Spirit and Knowledge </>.",
    ["<Highlight>【规则说明】</>\n\n<Title>逃离监狱</>\n1.你被困在危机四伏的监狱之中，突破重重机关，找到逃生点。\n2.超过其他狱友，获取更多的积分，赢取丰厚奖励。\n3.10分钟时间耗尽仍未完成逃脱，逃离失败。\n<Title>躲避光照</>\n1.监狱中会有巡逻光照不断扫过场地，被发现后会被锁链束缚。\n2.不要掉进毒液池中，也要躲避毒液花的攻击。\n<Title>符文谜题</>\n1.逃生出口需要破解符文屏障才能打开，需要在地面寻找散落的符文。\n2.累计找到16个符文后，屏障将被破除。"] = "<Highlight>【Rules】</>\n\n<Title>Escape from Prison</>\n1. You are trapped in a dangerous prison; break through various mechanisms to find the escape point. \n2. Surpass other inmates to earn more points and win generous rewards. \n3. If the escape is not completed within 10 minutes, the escape fails. \n<Title>Avoid the Light</>\n1. Patrol lights in the prison will constantly scan the area; being discovered will result in being bound by chains. \n2. Do not fall into the venom pools, and avoid attacks from venom flowers. \n<Title>Rune Puzzle</>\n1. The escape exit requires breaking the rune barrier, which requires finding scattered runes on the ground. \n2. After finding a total of 16 runes, the barrier will be broken.",
