    ["四方联赛每场第一、二名进入胜者组，第三、四名进入败者组；第二场结束后，按比赛结果确定本轮第1至第8名。\n战区筛选积分由<Highlight>单场名次积分</>与<Highlight>每轮最终排名积分</>累计组成：\n<Highlight>单场名次积分：</>第1名30分，第2名15分，第3名10分，第4名5分。\n<Highlight>第一轮最终排名积分：</>第1名60分，第2名50分，第3名45分，第4名40分，第5至第8名各10分。\n<Highlight>第二轮最终排名积分：</>第1名200分，第2名100分，第3名70分，第4名50分，第5至第8名各15分。\n<Highlight>同分排序规则：</>战区筛选排名优先按照<Highlight>战区筛选总积分</>由高到低排列。总积分相同时：第一轮或第二轮联赛结束后，按照俱乐部在本轮的<Highlight>最终排名</>排序，排名靠前者优先；四方联赛每轮第一场比赛结束后，本轮尚未产生最终排名，同分俱乐部暂不区分排名先后，当前展示顺序不代表本轮最终排名。"] = "The first and second place in each Four-Way League match enter the winner's bracket, and the third and fourth place enter the loser's bracket; after the second match, the 1st to 8th place for the round are determined based on the match results. \n Warzone screening points are composed of the accumulation of <Highlight> single-match ranking points </> and <Highlight> final round ranking points </>: \n <Highlight> Single-match ranking points: </> 1st place 30 points, 2nd place 15 points, 3rd place 10 points, 4th place 5 points. \n <Highlight> First round final ranking points: </> 1st place 60 points, 2nd place 50 points, 3rd place 45 points, 4th place 40 points, 5th to 8th place 10 points each. \n <Highlight> Second round final ranking points: </> 1st place 200 points, 2nd place 100 points, 3rd place 70 points, 4th place 50 points, 5th to 8th place 15 points each. \n <Highlight> Tie-breaking rules: </> Warzone screening rankings are prioritized by <Highlight> total warzone screening points </> from high to low. When total points are the same: After the first or second round of the league, sort according to the club's <Highlight> final ranking </> in this round, with higher rankings taking precedence; after the first match of each round of the Four-Way League, the final ranking for this round has not yet been generated, so clubs with the same points are not distinguished by ranking, and the current display order does not represent the final ranking of this round.",
